# start Validation Reply Form
_vrf_PLAT342_4TmPbI_n2_3_0m_5
;
PROBLEM: Low Bond Precision on  C-C Bonds ...............    0.04789 Ang.  
RESPONSE: Bond precision is low due to large libration for organic fragments, 
modulation and twinning. See refinement details section for details.
;
_vrf_PLAT910_4TmPbI_n2_3_0m_5
;
PROBLEM: Missing # of FCF Reflection(s) Below Theta(Min).         14 Note  
RESPONSE: Data were collected with a sealed tube molybdenum wavelength 
instrument with 0.6 mm beam size and the smallest suitable beam stop. The 
crystal to beam stop distance is not adjustable. For large unit cell sizes 
such as is the case here some reflections are obstructed by the beam stop (14 
out of a total of 113,768 independent reflections, or < 0.013%).
;

